WEBVTT

00:03:58.526 --> 00:04:00.945
but mostly the Olympics and the World Cup.

00:04:01.445 --> 00:04:05.908
And so we got to thinking:
What is it about these two events?

00:04:05.908 --> 00:04:10.621
What are the common factors that allow
women's sports to transcend

00:04:10.621 --> 00:04:11.956
for these fleeting moments?

00:04:11.998 --> 00:04:14.041
Because even at the Olympics,

00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:15.543
the men's swim times

00:04:15.584 --> 00:04:18.587
are just a fraction of a second
faster than the women's.

00:04:19.088 --> 00:04:23.509
These two events have
two crucial elements in common:

00:04:23.551 --> 00:04:26.304
stakes and storylines.

00:04:27.221 --> 00:04:31.309
This is what burns
at the center of sports.